   "text": "UCL Centre for Languages & International Education - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUCL Centre for Languages & International Education\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nUCL is amongst the best universities in the world. Academic excellence and disruptive thinking have been the status quo since 1826. UCL students are directly involved in research, equipping them for the future and inspiring a lifelong curiosity. We teach our students how to think, not what to think. Amongst the very best in the world8th in the world (QS World University Rankings 2022)2nd in UK for research power (REF 2021)1st in England to welcome students of any religion or social background.1st in England to welcome women to university education.1st in England to teach English, German, Chemistry, Engineering.A brave and progressive approach that has continued to this day.1st in England to have a fully open access university press.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n21/04/2026 05:27\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n21/04/2026 05:27\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £18,500.00\nMin: £13,800.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n52%\n26 of 50 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1826\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n16/12/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.ucl.ac.uk/scholarships/how-much-does-it-cost-study-ucl\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ycHeq8J0_Fk\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee -